      "role": "user",
      "content": "that got a bit garbled at the end, no worries. can you just pick up where you left off with that second argument? specifically, what are the actual claims regarding how those genetic traits or \"folk biology\" concepts supposedly manifest in different populations? i need the specific points they use to justify the hierarchy idea so i can prepare my rebuttal for the debate.",
